  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Research Initiative for Scientific Excellence - ARISE 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this action is to broaden and strengthen Africa&#xbf;s research and innovation ecosystem, contributing to Africa&#xbf;s shared prosperity through inclusive social and economic development. The specific objectives of this action are to enhance the capabilities of women and men African research leaders committed to a career research and teaching in Africa; to strengthen institutional research management and support systems to facilitate the flourishing of pan-African research; and to support the generation of cutting-edge research, that is locally relevant and globally competitive.</narrative>
  </description>
